  driver core: Replace dev->can_match with DEV_FLAG_CAN_MATCH
  driver core: Replace dev->dma_iommu with DEV_FLAG_DMA_IOMMU
  driver core: Replace dev->dma_skip_sync with DEV_FLAG_DMA_SKIP_SYNC
